{"ts": "2026-07-29T01:01:57", "session": "20260729-010131", "seq": 1, "kind": "note", "note": "verdict(offset): trials:\n\n  reference    small part of bottom left segment\n  byte2 = 01   the same\n  byte2 = 08   the same\n  byte3 = 00   the same\n  byte3 = d1   the same\n\nThe lit LED moved with: byte2 = 01, byte2 = 08, byte3 = 00, byte3 = d1.\n\nThat byte offsets the write into the strip, which is how the LEDs\npast byte 63 are reached. Sweep it to find the total LED count,\nthen teach omenled.device to send as many reports as the strip\nneeds."}
